<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
    />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <title>Housing AI Project</title>
  </head>

  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100%;
      background: #f5f7fb;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto,
        Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #1f2937;
    "
  >
    <!-- Preview Text -->
    <div
      style="
        display: none;
        max-height: 0;
        max-width: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        opacity: 0;
        color: transparent;
        mso-hide: all;
      "
    >
      Housing AI Project is almost ready. We'll email you again when it's
      available.
    </div>

    <table
      role="presentation"
      border="0"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      width="100%"
      style="
        border-collapse: collapse;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 32px 16px;
      "
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            role="presentation"
            border="0"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            width="560"
            style="
              width: 100%;
              max-width: 560px;
              border-collapse: collapse;
              background: #ffffff;
              border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
              border-radius: 16px;
            "
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 40px;
                  mso-line-height-rule: exactly;
                "
              >
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 28px;
                    font-size: 20px;
                    line-height: 1.4;
                    font-weight: 700;
                    color: #13294b;
                  "
                >
                  Housing AI Project
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    color: #374151;
                  "
                >
                  Hi,
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    color: #374151;
                  "
                >
                  You are receiving this message because you joined the Housing
                  AI Project waitlist through one of our social media posts.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    color: #374151;
                  "
                >
                  Housing AI Project is an independent student-built project and
                  is not affiliated with or endorsed by the University of
                  Illinois.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    color: #374151;
                  "
                >
                  The project brings apartment listings from multiple leasing
                  companies into one place for students to search and compare.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    color: #111827;
                  "
                >
                  We expect the website to become available within the next
                  several days.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 30px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    color: #374151;
                  "
                >
                  We will email you again when it is ready.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    color: #13294b;
                  "
                >
                  Housing AI Project
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 18px 40px 22px;
                  border-top: 1px solid #edf0f4;
                  text-align: center;
                  mso-line-height-rule: exactly;
                "
              >
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    color: #9ca3af;
                  "
                >
                  You are receiving this email because you joined the project
                  waitlist.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>